  m_text: "-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nBetween:
    <b>Christopher Anderson</b> (Applicant) and <b>Sharon Wright</b> (Respondent)\n\r\n1.
    The Applicant and the Respondent, who were married on June 12, 2006, \nare divorced,
    and the divorce takes effect 31 days after the date of this order.\n\r\n2. The
    Applicant and the Respondent shall have joint custody of the child \nof the marriage,
    Harry Anderson, born May 23, 2009, and shall make all major \ndecisions regarding
    the child\u2019s health, education, and welfare together.\n\r\n3. The child shall
    reside primarily with the Respondent.\n\r\n4. The Applicant shall have liberal
    and generous access to the child, \nincluding alternate weekends and holidays
    as agreed upon by the parties.\r\n\r\nDated at Alder Falls, this 17th day of
    February, 2014.\r\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
